{"hw":"ἐπιστάζω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἐπιστάζω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐπιστάζω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">let fall in drops upon</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">into, instil</b>, <span class=\"gk\">τινί τι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">871b18</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Orib.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">46.19.13</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Herod.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.81</span> </span>: metaph., <span class=\"gk\">ἐ. χάριν</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">shed</b> delight or honour, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">I.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4(3).72</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὀλίγον τοῦ μέλιτος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Luc.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">VH</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.24</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be</b> <b class=\"lex-tr\">dropped on</b>, <span class=\"gk\">ἐπειδὰν ἐπισταγῇ ὄνυχι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Dsc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.70</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Sor.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.91</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span>. intr., <b class=\"lex-tr\">bleed at the nose again</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Prorrh.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.148</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Coac.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">337</span> </span>.</div></div>"}